5,1,1,talk,Minako,,The current system is failing. We need data before committing to a year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. Intuition is a poor substitute for evidence in shared spaces.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I’m scared of the bathroom! Can we check the grout? It looks weird.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about the small costs. Who is buying the sponges lately?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,Let us look at the past. The note from previous tenants might help.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, fear is not a metric. We need objective time and cost data.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shizue, receipts are good, but we need to know who is actually present.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Okay! I will check the grout and the chat logs. Mystery time!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the receipts and the calendar. Peace requires clarity.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,I will examine the note and the stopwatch timing. Wisdom comes from observation.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will time a full pass and check the firm's terms.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the calendar and the kitchen usage logs.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I am ready to solve this mystery. Let’s see what the past says.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I hope this brings us harmony. I will check the spray stock too.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"May this process bring us closer, not further apart. Let us proceed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
