35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The data is clear. A full pass takes over two hours. That is significant.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The calendar confirms my suspicion. Presence is not equal. We must account for that.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,The grout is back! And the chat shows we always argue about reminders.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,I found the receipts. We are buying too much spray. And the calendar shows absences.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The previous tenants divided rooms permanently. By year two, they barely spoke.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, that is a warning. We need a system that forces interaction, not isolation.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, interaction is not the goal. Fairness is. The kitchen data supports this.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"I don’t want to guess anymore! If we know who is home, we can plan.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we know who is away, we can share the cost fairly. No one should pay for absence.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"If we divide the rooms, we divide the people. I fear that path.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,The firm requires someone to be present. That is a constraint we cannot ignore.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The kitchen data shows heavy users. They should carry more of the load.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"Can we make a chart? A big, colorful chart on the wall?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"A chart is good. But we must also track the money. The sponges, the bags.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,A chart is a map. But we must not forget the territory of our relationships.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
