62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,Option C sounds like a game! I can pick my favorite room. But is it fair?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option B costs money. But it saves us the arguments. I worry about the monthly bill.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option C is the path the previous tenants took. It led to silence. I advise against it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, fairness is not just about usage. It is about shared responsibility.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, shared responsibility does not mean shared burden. The data shows imbalance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,I like the idea of a chart for Option A. We can color-code the weeks!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"If we choose B, we must agree on the split. I want to know the exact cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"If we choose A, we must agree on what ""done"" means. Otherwise, the chart is empty.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,The firm's terms require presence. Option B is risky if we are all away.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Option A is the most logical. It is transparent. It can be adjusted if needed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"I am scared of the bathroom, but I can do it if I know when. Option A helps.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Benjamin. Transparency is key. Let us choose the rota.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I agree. A shared rhythm is better than a silent division. Let us choose A.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
